[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0000","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0010","text":"──好，那今天的训练就到这里！\n辛苦了，甜花酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0020","text":"辛苦了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0030","text":"——甜花，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0040","text":"啊……Producer先生……\n辛苦了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0050","text":"……甜花，你今天好像\n比平时状态要好呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0060","text":"是、是……吗……？\n嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0070","text":"哈哈\n是不是有什么好事发生？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0080","text":"嗯、嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0090","text":"千雪小姐……\n给我做了……可爱的发饰……──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0100","text":"──啊，这个……\n秘密…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0110","text":"……甜花？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0120","text":"还、还是……\n先保密……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0130","text":"Producer先生……\n什么也……不知道……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0140","text":"哦、哦\n知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0150","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0160","text":"──但、但是……\n再过一阵子……再问你……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_03_0170","text":"甜花现在……很期待的……\n好事……！"}]
